+    chooses the K that maximizes the expected tokens per second, (1 + sum_k prod_{i <= k} a_i) / T(K). The times of
+    depths not measured yet are extrapolated from the measured ones (at least QWEN38_MTP_COST, default 0.1, of a
+    step's time per draft), and acceptances of positions beyond the drafted ones drift towards the last observed
+    one, so that a high acceptance tries more drafts again. QWEN38_MTP_MIN (default 1) bounds K from below,
+    num_speculative_tokens (MTP_DEPTH) from above.
